# Lab 11 – Hyperparameter Tuning and AutoML

## Overview
This lab focused on improving machine learning models using hyperparameter tuning and AutoML.

## What I Learned
- The difference between model parameters and hyperparameters
- How Grid Search tests all selected parameter combinations
- How Random Search tests a random sample of parameter combinations
- How AutoML can automatically compare multiple models

## Tools Used
- Python
- scikit-learn
- AutoGluon
- Google Colab

## Reflection
This lab helped me understand how tuning can improve model performance and how AutoML can speed up the model selection process.
